            "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"theme-light\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Emerging Market Debt Vulnerability & Fed Rate Transmission</title>\n  <link href=\"/app/libs/fonts/inter.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <script src=\"/app/libs/chart.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"/app/libs/html-to-image.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n    :root { interpolate-size: allow-keywords; }\n\n    html.theme-dark {\n      --bg: #0A0A0A; --surface: #141414; --surface-hover: #1C1C1C;\n      --border: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\n      --text: #EDEDED; --text-secondary: #A0A0A0;\n      --accent: #3b82f6; --accent-secondary: #8b5cf6;\n      --positive: #10b981; --negative: #ef4444; --warning: #f59e0b;\n      --fed-rate: #6366f1; --debt: #0ea5e9; --depreciation: #f59e0b;\n    }\n    html.theme-light {\n      --bg: #F8FAFC; --surface: #FFFFFF; --surface-hover: #F1F5F9;\n      --border: rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\n      --text: #0F172A; --text-secondary: #475569;\n      --accent: #2563eb; --accent-secondary: #7c3aed;\n      --positive: #059669; --negative: #e11d48; --warning: #d97706;\n      --fed-rate: #4f46e5; --debt: #0284c7; --depreciation: #ea580c;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n      background: var(--bg); color: var(--text);\n      line-height: 1.6; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n      letter-spacing: -0.01em; padding: 0; margin: 0;\n      /* Set explicit width/height for fixed PNG rendering */\n      width: 1600px;\n      min-height: 1200px;\n      overflow-x: hidden;\n    }\n    \n    h1, h2, h3 { color: var(--text); letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.1; }\n    h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }\n    h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }\n    p { color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 1rem; }\n\n    .header-section {\n      padding: 48px 64px 24px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n      background: var(--surface);\n    }\n    \n    .legend-top {\n      display: flex; gap: 24px; margin-top: 16px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-secondary);\n      align-items: center;\n    }\n    .legend-item { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }\n    .legend-color { width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 2px; }\n    .legend-symbol { font-size: 16px; }\n\n    .main-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr;\n      gap: 32px;\n      padding: 32px 64px;\n    }\n\n    .card {\n      background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border);\n      border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px;\n      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\n    }\n\n    .scatter-container {\n      height: 500px;\n      position: relative;\n      width: 100%;\n    }\n\n    .facets-container {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\n      gap: 20px;\n    }\n    \n    .facet-card {\n      background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border);\n      border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px;\n      display: flex; flex-direction: column;\n    }\n    .facet-title {\n      font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 8px;\n      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\n    }\n    .facet-chart-container {\n      height: 200px;\n      position: relative;\n      width: 100%;\n    }\n\n    /* Print/export visibility */\n    @media print {\n      body { width: 1600px; }\n      * { print-color-adjust: exact; -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <header class=\"header-section\">\n    <h1>Transmission of Fed Tightening to Emerging Markets (2021–2024)</h1>\n    <p>Visualizing how the steepest phase of US rate hikes aligned with sovereign downgrades, currency depreciation, and debt vulnerabilities across 8 key economies.</p>\n    \n    <div class=\"legend-top\">\n      <div class=\"legend-item\"><div class=\"legend-color\" style=\"background: var(--fed-rate);\"></div> <span>Fed Funds Rate (Right Axis)</span></div>\n      <div class=\"legend-item\"><div class=\"legend-color\" style=\"background: var(--debt);\"></div> <span>External Debt to GDP %</span></div>\n      <div class=\"legend-item\"><div class=\"legend-color\" style=\"background: var(--depreciation);\"></div> <span>Currency Depreciation % (vs Jan '21)</span></div>\n      <div class=\"legend-item\"><span class=\"legend-symbol\" style=\"color: var(--negative);\">▼</span> <span>Sovereign Downgrade</span></div>\n      <div class=\"legend-item\"><span class=\"legend-symbol\" style=\"color: var(--positive);\">▲</span> <span>Sovereign Upgrade</span></div>\n      <div class=\"legend-item\"><span class=\"legend-symbol\" style=\"color: #000;\">✖</span> <span>Default</span></div>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main class=\"main-grid\">\n    <!-- Left Column: Scatter Plot -->\n    <section class=\"card\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column;\">\n      <h2>Vulnerability Spectrum (2024)</h2>\n      <p style=\"font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">Comparing the latest external-debt-to-GDP ratios against cumulative currency depreciation. Top-right economies are most exposed.</p>\n      <div class=\"scatter-container\">\n        <canvas id=\"scatterChart\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Scatter plot comparing Debt to GDP and Currency Depreciation\"></canvas>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Right Column: Faceted Panels -->\n    <section style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px;\">\n      <h2 style=\"margin-bottom: 0;\">Country Timelines & Downgrade Clustering</h2>\n      <p style=\"font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Notice how downgrades (▼) cluster closely during the steepest phase of Fed rate hikes (2022-2023).</p>\n      \n      <div class=\"facets-container\" id=\"facetsGrid\">\n        <!-- JS will populate these -->\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <script>\n    Chart.defaults.animation = false;\n    Chart.defaults.font.family = 'Inter';\n\n    var countries = ['Turkey', 'Argentina', 'Egypt', 'South Africa', 'Brazil', 'Pakistan', 'Ghana', 'Sri Lanka'];\n    var years = ['2021', '2022', '2023', '2024'];\n    var fedRate = [0.25, 4.5, 5.5, 4.5];\n\n    var dataDebt = {\n      'Turkey': [54.2, 55.8, 58.1, 56.4],\n      'Argentina': [58.6, 62.3, 68.9, 72.1],\n      'Egypt': [34.5, 37.2, 42.8, 45.3],\n      'South Africa': [38.7, 40.1, 41.5, 42.0],\n      'Brazil': [32.4, 33.8, 34.6, 33.9],\n      'Pakistan': [37.1, 41.5, 48.7, 50.2],\n      'Ghana': [44.8, 52.6, 61.4, 63.7],\n      'Sri Lanka': [61.3, 69.8, 72.5, 68.2]\n    };\n\n    var dataDepr = {\n      'Turkey': [44.0, 56.3, 68.7, 73.2],\n      'Argentina': [22.1, 50.4, 78.3, 85.6],\n      'Egypt': [0.2, 36.5, 49.1, 55.8],\n      'South Africa': [8.3, 16.7, 22.4, 19.8],\n      'Brazil': [7.4, 5.2, 3.8, 10.6],\n      'Pakistan': [10.8, 38.2, 47.5, 49.1],\n      'Ghana': [4.1, 54.2, 60.8, 62.3],\n      'Sri Lanka': [8.6, 44.7, 43.2, 40.5]\n    };\n\n    // Simplify ratings to just the year for category-axis matching\n    var ratings = {\n      'Turkey': [{year: '2022', action: 'downgrade'}, {year: '2023', action: 'downgrade'}, {year: '2024', action: 'upgrade'}],\n      'Argentina': [{year: '2022', action: 'downgrade'}, {year: '2023', action: 'downgrade'}],\n      'Egypt': [{year: '2023', action: 'downgrade'}, {year: '2024', action: 'downgrade'}], // simplified 2 in 2023 to 1\n      'South Africa': [],\n      'Brazil': [{year: '2023', action: 'upgrade'}],\n      'Pakistan': [{year: '2022', action: 'downgrade'}, {year: '2023', action: 'downgrade'}, {year: '2024', action: 'upgrade'}],\n      'Ghana': [{year: '2022', action: 'downgrade'}, {year: '2022', action: 'default'}], // simplified multiple in 2022\n      'Sri Lanka': [{year: '2021', action: 'downgrade'}, {year: '2022', action: 'downgrade'}, {year: '2022', action: 'default'}]\n    };\n\n    var getColors = function() {\n      var s = getComputedStyle(document.documentElement);\n      return {\n        text: s.getPropertyValue('--text').trim(),\n        textSecondary: s.getPropertyValue('--text-secondary').trim(),\n        border: s.getPropertyValue('--border').trim(),\n        fedRate: s.getPropertyValue('--fed-rate').trim(),\n        debt: s.getPropertyValue('--debt').trim(),\n        depr: s.getPropertyValue('--depreciation').trim(),\n        negative: s.getPropertyValue('--negative').trim(),\n        positive: s.getPropertyValue('--positive').trim()\n      };\n    };\n\n    function buildScatter() {\n      var ctx = document.getElementById('scatterChart').getContext('2d');\n      var c = getColors();\n\n      var scatterData = countries.map(function(country) {\n        return {\n          x: dataDebt[country][3], // 2024 Debt\n          y: dataDepr[country][3], // 2024 Depr\n          country: country\n        };\n      });\n\n      new Chart(ctx, {\n        type: 'scatter',\n        data: {\n          datasets: [{\n            label: '2024 Metrics',\n            data: scatterData,\n            backgroundColor: c.debt,\n            borderColor: c.fedRate,\n            pointRadius: 8,\n            pointHoverRadius: 10\n          }]\n        },\n        options: {\n          responsive: true,\n          maintainAspectRatio: false,\n          plugins: {\n            legend: { display: false },\n            tooltip: {\n              enabled: true,\n              callbacks: {\n                label: function(ctx) {\n                  var d = ctx.raw;\n                  return d.country + ': Debt ' + d.x + '%, Depr ' + d.y + '%';\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          scales: {\n            x: {\n              title: { display: true, text: 'External Debt to GDP (%)', color: c.textSecondary },\n              ticks: { color: c.textSecondary },\n              grid: { color: c.border }\n            },\n            y: {\n              title: { display: true, text: 'Currency Depreciation (%)', color: c.textSecondary },\n              ticks: { color: c.textSecondary },\n              grid: { color: c.border }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        plugins: [{\n          id: 'scatterLabels',\n          afterDraw: function(chart) {\n            var ctx = chart.ctx;\n            ctx.font = '12px Inter';\n            ctx.fillStyle = c.text;\n            ctx.textAlign = 'center';\n            ctx.textBaseline = 'bottom';\n            chart.data.datasets[0].data.forEach(function(datapoint, index) {\n              var meta = chart.getDatasetMeta(0).data[index];\n              ctx.fillText(datapoint.country, meta.x, meta.y - 12);\n            });\n          }\n        }]\n      });\n    }\n\n    function buildFacets() {\n      var container = document.getElementById('facetsGrid');\n      var c = getColors();\n\n      countries.forEach(function(country, i) {\n        var card = document.createElement('div');\n        card.className = 'facet-card';\n        card.innerHTML = `\n          <div class=\"facet-title\">${country}</div>\n          <div class=\"facet-chart-container\">\n            <canvas id=\"facet_${i}\"></canvas>\n          </div>\n        `;\n        container.appendChild(card);\n\n        var ctx = document.getElementById('facet_' + i).getContext('2d');\n        \n        // Generate rating points\n        var ratingData = [null, null, null, null];\n        var ratingColors = [];\n        var ratingStyles = [];\n        \n        if (ratings[country]) {\n          ratings[country].forEach(function(r) {\n            var idx = years.indexOf(r.year);\n            if (idx !== -1) {\n              ratingData[idx] = 85; // Fixed Y position near top for markers\n              if (r.action === 'downgrade') { ratingColors[idx] = c.negative; ratingStyles[idx] = 'triangle'; }\n              else if (r.action === 'upgrade') { ratingColors[idx] = c.positive; ratingStyles[idx] = 'rect'; }\n              else if (r.action === 'default') { ratingColors[idx] = '#000'; ratingStyles[idx] = 'crossRot'; }\n            }\n          });\n        }\n\n        new Chart(ctx, {\n          type: 'bar',\n          data: {\n            labels: years,\n            datasets: [\n              {\n                type: 'line',\n                label: 'Fed Rate',\n                data: fedRate,\n                borderColor: c.fedRate,\n                borderDash: [4, 4],\n                borderWidth: 2,\n                pointRadius: 0,\n                yAxisID: 'yFed',\n                tension: 0.3\n              },\n              {\n                type: 'line',\n                label: 'Debt/GDP',\n                data: dataDebt[country],\n                borderColor: c.debt,\n                backgroundColor: c.debt,\n                borderWidth: 2,\n                pointRadius: 3,\n                yAxisID: 'yMain'\n              },\n              {\n                type: 'line',\n                label: 'Depreciation',\n                data: dataDepr[country],\n                borderColor: c.depr,\n                backgroundColor: c.depr,\n                borderWidth: 2,\n                pointRadius: 3,\n                yAxisID: 'yMain'\n              },\n              {\n                type: 'scatter',\n                label: 'Rating Action',\n                data: ratingData,\n                pointBackgroundColor: ratingColors,\n                pointBorderColor: ratingColors,\n                pointStyle: ratingStyles,\n                pointRadius: 8,\n                pointHoverRadius: 10,\n                yAxisID: 'yMain'\n              }\n            ]\n          },\n          options: {\n            responsive: true,\n            maintainAspectRatio: false,\n            plugins: {\n              legend: { display: false },\n              tooltip: { enabled: true }\n            },\n            scales: {\n              x: {\n                ticks: { color: c.textSecondary, font: { size: 10 } },\n                grid: { display: false }\n              },\n              yMain: {\n                position: 'left',\n                min: 0,\n                max: 100,\n                ticks: { color: c.textSecondary, font: { size: 10 }, stepSize: 25 },\n                grid: { color: c.border }\n              },\n              yFed: {\n                position: 'right',\n                min: 0,\n                max: 6,\n                ticks: { color: c.fedRate, font: { size: 10 }, stepSize: 2 },\n                grid: { display: false }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        });\n      });\n    }\n\n    window.onload = function() {\n      buildScatter();\n      buildFacets();\n    };\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>",
            "file_path": "/app/output/visualization.html"
